      "content": "The increasing order of reactivity of the following compounds towards reaction with alkyl halides directly is \n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/hp8LPFswHloTQ2jur/EdGyjr3WG0RQUimdvtm32MoU103JW/24m7gC4fejoKaFg8s8oHaY/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 218 English 1\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">(A)</h2>\n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/cgqcIAySpucFCDUyJ/P2VJdGJgSjynZe0XapICsnUUsI6YW/jUGGUVAfMtawkIZRNCwiSi/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 218 English 2\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">(B)</h2>\n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/ZTW1N1CNLcAG1bGp7/OZYvDyLC5c6xkm1TPsnkACUfSJJ1h/wrhFqR8lhLwqLNsxJZd7PO/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 218 English 3\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">(C)</h2>\n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/azOK8ctozFzI7StAi/zwbKilYwleJvHQP9L7CMvbT38rBVu/3ZrfwHBcroT8raYLZTFrDZ/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 218 English 4\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\">(D)</h2>\n",
